 "_type_note": "Type drives the website's wording and the calendar icon. Codes carrying hours get their type from the start time (>=20:00 night, >=13:00 afternoon, else day) unless they are leave. 14 Term 5 codes were typed 'off' when this file was first extracted, because the old Term 5 parser derived the type from the hours and bypassed the classifier these values came from.",
