 "_holiday_note": "A blank cell is a ward day only on an ordinary weekday. On weekends, NSW public holidays (computed in rosterlib.nsw_public_holidays) and any date in extra_holidays, a blank means off; blank_holiday is the code shown instead. Add hospital picnic day etc. as {\"YYYY-MM-DD\": \"Picnic Day\"}."
